The '''Loudmouth Bass''' is a {{Common}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A {{Item|Seal's Treat Bag}} has a {{Green|11.<span style{{=}}"text-decoration:overline;">1</span>%}} ({{Green|1}} in {{Green|9}}) chance to contain '''Loudmouth Bass'''.

A '''Loudmouth Bass''' can also be obtained as a Minor Reward during [[Raffle of the Century]] event, or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Loudmouth Bass''' can be used to challenge another player holding one to a duel. The winner's '''Loudmouth Bass''' will gain weight, while the losing party will lose their '''Loudmouth Bass'''.

The '''Loudmouth Bass''' upgrades its rarity depending on its weight:
{| class="wikitable centertext"
! Rarity
! Weight
|-
| {{Common}}
| 0-49 lb
|-
| {{Uncommon}}
| 50-2,499 lb
|-
| {{Rare}}
| 2,500-9,999 lb
|-
| {{Epic}}
| 10,000-24,999 lb
|-
| {{Legendary}}
| 25,000-49,999 lb
|-
| {{Mythic}}
| 50,000-99,999 lb
|-
| {{Divine}}
| 100,000+ lb
|}

The losing party is rewarded with {{Item|Fish Food|amount=1}}, and {{Green|1}} {{Skill|Social|XP}} for every {{Green|10}} lb their '''Loudmouth Bass''' had, with a minimum of {{Green|100}} and a maximum of {{Green|500,000}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}.

The XP gained can be calculated using the following formula:

<math>
\text{SocialXPGained} = \max\left(100, \min\left(\left\lfloor\frac{\text{LoserBassWeight}}{10}\right\rfloor, 500\,000\right)\right)
</math>

For example: If the losing player's '''Loudmouth Bass''' weight is between {{Green|0}} and {{Green|1,000}} lb, then they will always get {{Green|100}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}. If the weight was {{Green|1,010}} lb, they will get 
{{Green|101}} {{Skill|Social|XP}}.

If losing player's '''Loudmouth Bass''' weight was more than {{Green|50}} lb, they will also get a {{Item|Skeleton the Fish}}.

