The '''Night Saver''' is an {{Uncommon}} block that is unlocked at {{Coll|Nether Quartz 2|img = t}}. It can be used to unlock the Island Time menu on a {{Zone|Private Island}} or {{Zone|The Garden}} to make it always night time on the island.

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
