 |A2 = Nether Quartz, 5 |B2 = Nether Quartz, 5 |C2 = Nether Quartz, 5
 |A3 = Brown Mushroom   |B3 = Brown Mushroom   |C3 = Brown Mushroom
 |Output = Night Saver
 }}
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |requirement = {{Coll|Nether Quartz 2}}
 |A1 = Glass            |B1 = Glass            |C1 = Glass
 |A2 = Nether Quartz, 5 |B2 = Nether Quartz, 5 |C2 = Nether Quartz, 5
 |A3 = Red Mushroom     |B3 = Red Mushroom     |C3 = Red Mushroom
 |Output = Night Saver
 }}
}}

== Usage ==
A {{Item|Day Saver}} followed by a '''Night Saver''' can be used to unlock the Island Time menu on a {{zone|Private Island}} or {{zone|The Garden}}, after which there will be an option to set the time in one hour increments, as well as whether to freeze the time.

It allows mobs that generate naturally at night to spawn constantly. This can be used to farm {{MobSprite|Bat;Bats}} more efficiently.

== Interface ==
The '''Night Saver''' originally featured its own interface when placed down. However, after the 0.19.9 update, this was merged with the [[Day Saver]] and replaced by the Island Time menu found under the Island Properties menu on the {{Zone|Private Island}} or within the [[Desk (The Garden)|Desk]] inside {{Zone|The Garden}}
{{/UI}}

