A '''Sneaky Tiki''' is a [[Mob]] that can be found in the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}} and {{zone|Torrhus Heights}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Sneaky Tikis''' spawn as a totem of heads in the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}} and {{zone|Torrhus Heights}}. When left-clicked, the clicked head and the one above it (or the bottom one, if the top one is clicked), will rotate clockwise from the head-down point of view, and the opposite direction when right-clicked. If the top 2 heads are facing the same direction, they will stop rotating. When all three are facing the same direction, the '''Sneaky Tiki''' awakens and attacks the player.

