The '''Weather Node''' is an {{Uncommon}} block that can be used to allow changing the weather on a {{Zone|Private Island}} through the [[Settings|Island Properties Settings]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |requirement = {{Coll|Prismarine Shard 6}}
 |A1 = Enchanted Redstone Dust |B1 = Enchanted Redstone Dust |C1 = Enchanted Redstone Dust
 |A2 = Enchanted Redstone Dust |B2 = Block of Lapis Lazuli   |C2 = Enchanted Redstone Dust
 |A3 = Enchanted Redstone Dust |B3 = Enchanted Redstone Dust |C3 = Enchanted Redstone Dust
 |Output = Weather Node
 }}
}}

== Usage ==
When right clicked on [[Settings|Island Properties Settings]] menu, the Weather Node gets consumed and added to the features that allows to opens a menu to change the island's weather, which can be set to sunny, raining, or thundering. The selected weather will persist until another is chosen.

The {{Item|Weather Wand}} can remotely access a placed Weather Node while its user is on their island.

